  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "hook-retirement",
      "text": "Ronaldo has retired from international football...",
      "emotion": "dramatic",
      "rate": "+4%",
      "pitch": "-5Hz",
      "start": 0.22,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "end": 3.22,
      "words": 6
    },
    {
      "id": "hook-leagues",
      "text": "But some men are still playing in three different leagues.",
      "emotion": "suspense",
      "rate": "+8%",
      "pitch": "-3Hz",
      "start": 3.65,
      "duration": 2.736,
      "end": 6.386,
      "words": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "transfer-market",
      "text": "In the relationship transfer market, some players don't scout one club. They send DMs to five, negotiate with three, and sign nowhere exclusively.",
      "emotion": "curiosity",
      "rate": "+22%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 7.05,
      "duration": 8.472,
      "end": 15.522,
      "words": 23
    },
    {
      "id": "signing",
      "text": "First comes scouting. That's the talking stage. Then the signing ceremony. Suddenly, you're officially his number one striker.",
      "emotion": "playful",
      "rate": "+13%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 15.9,
      "duration": 7.104,
      "end": 23.004,
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "preseason",
      "text": "Then comes pre-season. Training sessions. Friendly matches. Chemistry building. Everybody is suddenly playing like they're chasing the Ballon d'Or.",
      "emotion": "confidence",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "pitch": "+0Hz",
      "start": 23.98,
      "duration": 8.832,
      "end": 32.812,
      "words": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "league",
      "text": "But after the first major trophy? Some managers lose interest. The player starts getting fewer minutes. Suddenly, there are transfer rumors.",
      "emotion": "savage",
      "rate": "+11%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 33.2,
      "duration": 8.496,
      "end": 41.696,
      "words": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "sale",
      "text": "Then comes the breakup. Official statement: we have mutually agreed to terminate the contract. But somehow, the player is still on loan and available for friendly matches.",
      "emotion": "deadpan",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "start": 44.35,
      "duration": 9.48,
      "end": 53.83,
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "return",
      "text": "And just when you think the transfer window is closed... the former club sends a late-night offer. Can we talk? The player is suddenly back in negotiations.",
      "emotion": "suspense",
      "rate": "+13%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 55.15,
      "duration": 8.544,
      "end": 63.694,
      "words": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "reveal",
      "text": "At this point, forget the Premier League, forget Champions League... this is clearly a situationship with football terminology.",
      "emotion": "reflection",
      "rate": "+11%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "start": 66.0,
      "duration": 6.864,
      "end": 72.864,
      "words": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "punchline",
      "text": "And somehow... this is not a football conversation.",
      "emotion": "deadpan",
      "rate": "-2%",
      "pitch": "-4Hz",
      "start": 74.4,
      "duration": 3.816,
      "end": 78.216,
      "words": 8
    }
